Copyright (C) United Electronic Industries, Inc. (UEI)
All rights reserved.

Each file is licensed as stated in its own header (SPDX-License-Identifier
line or license notice). The full text of every license is in the LICENSES/
directory. This file summarizes the licenses of the files built into the
example programs under /usr/local/examples (see each example's
Makefile.arm) and UeiPacUtils.o. If this summary and a file header
disagree, the file header applies.


