2. BSD-3-Clause
   Copyright (c) 2005, David M Howard (nmeap NMEA parser)
-----------------
   Built into SampleGPS:
   SampleGPS/nmeap01.c

   Headers:
   SampleGPS/nmeap.h      SampleGPS/nmeap_def.h

   [REVIEW NOTE - remove before commit] The nmeap headers say "licensed ...
   under the BSD Open Source License, see the file COPYING" but COPYING is
   missing from SampleGPS. Add upstream nmeap's COPYING (BSD) to confirm
   BSD-3-Clause.


External components (not included in this directory)
----------------------------------------------------
SampleLibUSB dynamically links libusb (separate recipe). Examples link UEI
libraries from daqlib/ueipallib.


Files not built/installed for the ARM (SoloX) target
----------------------------------------------------
Windows/Visual Studio project files, tests and other build variants in the
SVN module are not part of the Yocto package and are not covered by this
summary.



Per-file header format
----------------------
   // SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-UEI-Proprietary
   // Copyright (C) 2026 United Electronic Industries, Inc.


Yocto recipe: ueiexamples   LICENSE = "Proprietary & BSD-3-Clause"
